# ─── Session / cookies / local state ───────────────────────────────────
cookies.txt
# ⚠️ ANCHORED (2026-09-14). A bare `session.json` matches at ANY depth, and it
# silently swallowed `packages/hub/__tests__/surfaces/session.json` — a frozen
# surface for the `/session` subpath, which would have existed locally, been
# absent from the pushed tree, and made every local gate pass while CI failed
# on something unrelated. `sources-tracked` caught it. These rules are for
# local state at the repo root; `*.session` still covers the general shape.
/session.json
*.session
*.lockfile.local
.firebaserc.local

